mission "The Stormhaven Engagement"
    name "The Stormhaven Engagement"
    description "Sink the five escorts in the Outer Roadstead, then return to Stormhaven and secure the repair yard."
    source "Mariner's Rest"
    destination "Stormhaven"
    reward 1320
    objective kills 5
    battlefield "The Outer Roadstead" 11500 7200
    enemy "The Outer Roadstead Guard 1"
    enemy "The Outer Roadstead Guard 2"
    enemy "The Outer Roadstead Guard 3"
    enemy "The Outer Roadstead Guard 4"
    enemy "The Outer Roadstead Guard 5"
    speaker offer "Harbourmaster"
    speaker visit "Harbourmaster"
    speaker complete "Harbourmaster"
    to offer
        has "The False Beacon: done"
    on offer
        conversation
            `Five Company escorts have taken station in the Outer Roadstead while the Meridian Star is being repaired.`
            `The repair crews work day and night. If the escorts hold their line until the flagship is ready, Ashcombe will escape again.`
            `The ships are spread across a wide anchorage. The free fleet must disable the screen before the repair work is complete.`
            choice
                `(I will take this voyage. Tell me the course.)`
                    goto accept_job
                `(What makes this business so important?)`
                    goto more_details
                `(I have other waters to sail.)`
                    goto decline_job
            label more_details
                `The ships are spread across a wide anchorage. The free fleet must disable the screen before the repair work is complete.`
                choice
                    `(Then I will see it done.)`
                        goto accept_job
                    `(Not this time.)`
                        goto decline_job
            label accept_job
                `Fen sends a pilot boat to guide your fleet. “Do not waste time chasing wreckage. The flagship is the prize, and the clock is running.”`
                accept
            label decline_job
                `The officer nods and rolls the chart closed. The offer will remain here if you change your mind.`
                close
    on accept
        log "Accepted The Stormhaven Engagement. Sink the five escorts in the Outer Roadstead, then return to Stormhaven and secure the repair yard."
    on visit
        conversation
            `The repair yard is captured, but the Meridian Star has already left. Its course points toward Last Light and the edge of the chart.`
    on complete
        conversation
            `Ashcombe is running out of safe harbours.`
        log "Completed The Stormhaven Engagement. Received 1320 gold. Ashcombe is running out of safe harbours."
